{"suttaId":"sn12.72-81","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-ii","vriCode":"s0302m.mul","paras":[573,589],"vripara":"72"},"segments":{"sn12.72-81:0.3":"2-11. Jātisuttādidasakaṃ","sn12.72-81:1.1":"Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati … pe …","sn12.72-81:1.2":"jātiṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:2.1":"(3) Bhavaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:3.1":"(4) Upādānaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:4.1":"(5) Taṇhaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:5.1":"(6) Vedanaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:6.1":"(7) Phassaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:7.1":"(8) Saḷāyatanaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:8.1":"(9) Nāmarūpaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:9.1":"(10) Viññāṇaṃ nappajānanti … pe ….","sn12.72-81:10.1":"(11)“Saṅkhāre nappajānanti, saṅkhārasamudayaṃ nappajānanti, saṅkhāranirodhaṃ nappajānanti, saṅkhāranirodhagāminiṃ paṭipadaṃ nappajānanti … pe … saṅkhāre pajānanti … pe …","sn12.72-81:10.3":"sayaṃ abhiññā sacchikatvā upasampajja viharantī”ti.","sn12.72-81:10.4":"Ekādasamaṃ.","sn12.72-81:10.5":"Samaṇabrāhmaṇavaggo aṭṭhamo.","sn12.72-81:11.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","sn12.72-81:11.1":"Paccayekādasa vuttā,","sn12.72-81:11.2":"catusaccavibhajjanā;","sn12.72-81:11.3":"Samaṇabrāhmaṇavaggo,","sn12.72-81:11.4":"nidāne bhavati aṭṭhamo.","sn12.72-81:12.0":"Vagguddānaṃ –","sn12.72-81:12.1":"Buddho āhāro dasabalo,","sn12.72-81:12.2":"kaḷāro gahapatipañcamo;","sn12.72-81:12.3":"Dukkhavaggo mahāvaggo,","sn12.72-81:12.4":"aṭṭhamo samaṇabrāhmaṇoti."},"unsure":["sn12.72-81:10.1"],"attha":{"book":"Spk-ii","bookName":"Nidānavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0302a.att","from":469,"to":472,"paras":[{"para":469,"vripara":"71-72","refs":["sn12.72-81:1"],"lines":["71-72. Samaṇabrāhmaṇavagge jarāmaraṇādīsu ekekapadavasena ekekaṃ katvā ekādasa suttāni vuttāni, tāni uttānatthānevāti."],"lineRefs":[["sn12.72-81:1"]]},{"para":470,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn12.72-81:1"],"lines":["Samaṇabrāhmaṇavaggo aṭṭhamo."],"lineRefs":[["sn12.72-81:1"]]},{"para":471,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn12.72-81:1"],"lines":["Antarapeyyālaṃ"],"lineRefs":[["sn12.72-81:1"]]},{"para":472,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn12.72-81:1"],"lines":["Satthusuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn12.72-81:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-ii","bookName":"Nidānavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0302t.tik","from":455,"to":459,"paras":[{"para":455,"vripara":"71-72","refs":["sn12.72-81:1"],"lines":["71-72. <b>Ekekaṃ</b> suttaṃ <b>katvā ekādasa suttāni vuttāni</b> avijjāya vasena desanāya anāgatattā, tathānāgamanañcassā catusaccavasena ekekassa padassa uddhaṭattā.","Kāmañca “āsavasamudayā avijjāsamudayo”ti attheva aññattha suttapadaṃ, idha pana veneyyajjhāsayavasena tathā na vuttanti daṭṭhabbaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn12.72-81:1"],["sn12.72-81:1"]]},{"para":456,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn12.72-81:1"],"lines":["Jarāmaraṇasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn12.72-81:1"]]},{"para":457,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn12.72-81:1"],"lines":["Samaṇabrāhmaṇavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn12.72-81:1"]]},{"para":458,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn12.72-81:1"],"lines":["Antarapeyyālavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn12.72-81:1"]]},{"para":459,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn12.72-81:1"],"lines":["Satthusuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn12.72-81:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
